  q(627,"recall","Neuropathy type of CMT-1 vs CMT-2 is:","Demyelinating disease vs axonal disease","Axonal disease vs demyelinating disease","Demyelinating in both","Axonal in both",exp="Neuropathy: Demyelinating disease (CMT-1) vs Axonal disease (CMT-2)"),
