  q(636,"recall","MMN-CB is characterised by:","Pure motor neuropathy with associated atrophy, lasting years, asymmetric, upper limb > lower limb","Pure sensory neuropathy with atrophy","Symmetric proximal weakness","Cranial nerve predominant weakness",exp="MMN-CB: pure motor neuropathy with associated atrophy; lasting for years; asymmetric presentation; upper limb > lower limb involvement"),
